# Scratch portfolio/brokerage CSVs dropped at the repo root while working on the
# money module. Ignored by shape rather than by name: this repo is public, and a
# broker export is exactly the file that carries an account number if the next
# one is a real download rather than a synthetic fixture.
/*.csv

